					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Ok, so this is a unique idea for an SCP, and I love it. I do have one problem, it’s name. «&nbsp;Damej&nbsp;» is not Urkranian. Пошкодження, is Ukrainian for damage. Demej, would most likely be Hindi. Or it would be Gujarati, and Indian language. I do get that it’s more of a joke though, so I’m not upset or anything. :)</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
